---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT t.a FROM t JOIN (SELECT a, count(*) AS n FROM u GROUP BY a) g ON t.a + (SELECT max(a) FROM u) = g.a WHERE t.b = 'x'"
---
Project [a#0]
+- Join Inner, ((a#0 + scalar-subquery) == a#3)
   :  +- Aggregate [], [max(a#6) AS max(a)#8]
   :     +- Shift +3
   :        +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#3] (shared #1)
   :- Project [a#0]
   :  +- Filter (b#1 == 'x')
   :     +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0, b#1]
   +- Aggregate [a#3], [a#3]
      +- Shared #1, printed above
